'''Christopher T. Johnson''' (born December 3, 1960) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[Safety (American football position)|strong safety]] for the [[Philadelphia Eagles]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL).  He played [[college football]] for the [[Millersville Marauders football|Millersville Marauders]].<ref>{{cite news |author=<!-- not stated --> |date=October 13, 1987 |title=Pats Get Flutie, Johnson Cut |url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/lancaster-new-era-pats-get-flutie-johns/180836876/ |work=[[Lancaster New Era]] |access-date=September 10, 2025}}</ref>
